  ],
  "details": "<p>There are a number of international archaeological projects working in this area, including the <a href=\"http://www.cyrenaica.org/\">Cyrenaica Archaeological Project</a>. Joyce Reynolds' long-awaited <a href=\"http://ircyr.kcl.ac.uk//\">corpus of the inscriptions of Roman Cyrenaica</a> is now in preparation for digital publication.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient region (the environs of the city of Cyrene) that lies in the eastern part of modern Libya.",
